# Intentionally empty of registry scope lines.
#
# Publishers (CI, release operators) supply the target registry via the
# AGENTS_JS_PUBLISH_REGISTRY environment variable — `scripts/publish-all.ts`
# passes it to `npm publish --registry <url>` explicitly. See
# `scripts/release-config.ts` and `docs/develop/contribute.md`.
#
# For local resolution of published `@agents-js/*` packages, add a scoped
# registry + auth token to your user-level `~/.npmrc` (uncommitted). Every
# internal dep inside this monorepo is workspace-resolved by Bun, so no
# scoped-registry pin is needed here for day-to-day development or CI.
